# QLeaves catalogue built from the client's photographs (C:\Users\HP\Desktop\plannts, November 2026).
#
# Photo numbers are the position of each file in the folders sorted by name (bouganvilla 0-7,
# indoor plants 8-110, table-top plants 111-121); process_plant_photos.py resolves them to file names
# and records both in the manifest. Identification was done visually from the photographs:
#   confidence "high"   - the plant is unmistakable;
#   confidence "medium" - the genus is certain, the variety is the most likely one;
#   confidence "low"    - only the genus (or less) is certain; the listing is worded cautiously and
#                         flagged for the shop to verify before it is published.
# Every new listing is an unpublished draft with no price: the shop sets the price and stock in admin.

